# CNAME File for Custom Domain

# 

# Rename this file to “CNAME” (without .example extension) and replace

# the content with your custom domain name.

# 

# Example:

# resilience-inc.global

# 

# OR with www:

# www.resilience-inc.global

# 

# Then configure your DNS provider with:

# - CNAME record: www -> resilience-inc.github.io

# - A records for apex domain (if not using www):

# 185.199.108.153

# 185.199.109.153

# 185.199.110.153

# 185.199.111.153

# 

# After setup, enable HTTPS in GitHub Pages settings

# REMOVE THIS COMMENT AND ADD YOUR DOMAIN BELOW:

resilience-inc.global

